 * Forbidden architecture:
 *
 *     grammar
 *         -> InteroperabilityAST
 *         -> InteroperabilityIR
 *
 * Correct architecture:
 *
 *     grammar
 *         -> domain-neutral AST
 *         -> interoperability semantic model
 *         -> canonical IR/domain IR
